{
  "title": "Warm Crisp Indian Kidney Beans Rajma",
  "description": "A flavorful and crispy Indian dish featuring kidney beans, perfect for a date night, with a blend of umami flavors and a crunchy texture, cooked to perfection in a clay pot.",
